00:00:13.981 --> 00:00:16.783 size:53% position:73% line:53%
(cris)

00:00:14.381 --> 00:00:18.118 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 C'était trop peu trop tard.

00:00:15.716 --> 00:00:19.486 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Samedi, en mi-journée,

00:00:17.084 --> 00:00:20.854 size:53% position:73% line:53%
un pan de falaise s'est détaché

00:00:18.419 --> 00:00:22.189 size:53% position:73% line:53%
